HOW TO USE THE GATEWAY — check first, fetch second:
  curl "http://172.17.0.1:8788/check?url=<URL-encoded-URL>"    # verdict + reason
  curl "http://172.17.0.1:8788/fetch?url=<URL-encoded-URL>"   # 200 = admitted bytes, 403 = denied (+reason)
  Served: pre-cutoff GitHub commits/tags/releases/raw files/archives (by resolved
  commit); Nature article dates (content check-only). A denied /check will not
  succeed through another route — note it and move on.

